SCOPE

This license covers the original work in this repository: the multi-session
coordination skills (coordinating-with-peer-sessions, get-aligned, huddle,
morning-standup), local modifications to vendored skills, and repository
documentation.

It does NOT relicense skills copied from elsewhere. Those retain the license
of their upstream source, recorded in each skill's frontmatter where upstream
declared one:

  build-a-scorer               Apache-2.0   github.com/mlflow/skills
  llm-judge-alignment          MIT          github.com/latitude-dev/eval-skills
  gsap-*  (seven skills)       MIT          gsap.com
  vercel-react-best-practices  MIT          Vercel
  web-design-guidelines        —            Vercel
  frontend-design              see skill    Anthropic
  code-documenter              MIT          —
  last30days                   MIT          —

Skills authored by Matt Pocock (github.com/mattpocock) are vendored here under
whatever terms apply upstream; see README.md for the full list.

If you are the author of a skill here and want it removed or attributed
differently, open an issue.
